4	4	# Mitsue Village AI Data Center\n\nWelcome to the project wiki.\n\n## Pages\n\n* [[Documents]] - All project documents\n* [[Stakeholders]] - Organisations and individuals\n* [[How-To]] - Scripts and operational guides\n\n## Quick Links\n\n* [Codeberg repository](https://codeberg.org/YR-Design/mitsue-ai-data-center)\n* [GitHub mirror](https://github.com/robouden/mitsue-ai-data-center)\n* [Gantt chart](http://localhost:8080/projects/mistue-ai-data-center/gantt)\n
6	4	# Stakeholders\n\n| Document | Link |\n|---|---|\n| Stakeholder List (EN) | [view](https://codeberg.org/YR-Design/mitsue-ai-data-center/src/branch/main/mitsue_stakeholders.md) |\n| Stakeholder List (JP) | [view](https://codeberg.org/YR-Design/mitsue-ai-data-center/src/branch/main/mitsue_stakeholders_jp.md) |\n| Interactive Graph (EN) | [view](https://codeberg.org/YR-Design/mitsue-ai-data-center/src/branch/main/mitsue_stakeholder_graph.html) |\n| Interactive Graph (JP) | [view](https://codeberg.org/YR-Design/mitsue-ai-data-center/src/branch/main/mitsue_stakeholder_graph_jp.html) |\n\n## Key Categories\n\n* Village & Government - Mitsue village, Nara Prefecture, METI, MIC, 環境省\n* International - Dutch Consul General, Joi Ito, Ray Ozzie\n* Technical Partners - Data center operators, biomass/biogas suppliers\n* Funding - NEDO, JST, 地方創生 grants, private investors\n* Community - Local residents, Safecast, universities\n
7	4	# How-To & Operational Guides\n\n## Start OpenProject after reboot\n\n```\nbash ~/Documents/Mitsue/Mitsue\\ Village\\ Project\\ AI\\ data\\ center/openproject_start.sh\n```\n\n## Backup & Restore\n\n```\nbash openproject_backup.sh\nbash openproject_restore.sh\n```\n\n## Update Document Headers\n\nAfter editing any .md file:\n\n```\ncd "/home/rob/Documents/Mitsue/Mitsue Village Project AI data center"\npython3 update_doc_headers.py filename.md\n```\n\nAfter editing or creating a PDF:\n\n```\npython3 update_pdf_headers.py filename.pdf\n```\n\n## Push to repositories\n\n```\ngit push origin main && git push github main\n```\n
8	4	# OpenProject — VPS Setup Guide\n\nMove OpenProject from Rob's laptop to a VPS so all collaborators can access it.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 or Debian 12 VPS\n* Minimum **4 GB RAM, 2 vCPU** (8 GB / 4 vCPU recommended)\n* Ports 80, 443 (HTTPS) and optionally 8080 open\n* A domain name pointing at the VPS (for HTTPS)\n\n## Recommended providers\n\n| Provider | Plan | Cost | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Hetzner | CX22 (4GB/2vCPU) | ~€4.50/mo | Best value |\n| Vultr | 4GB | ~$24/mo | Tokyo datacenter available |\n| Contabo | VPS S | ~€5/mo | High RAM |\n| DigitalOcean | Basic 4GB | ~$24/mo | Singapore closest to Japan |\n\n## One-command setup\n\nSSH into the fresh VPS, then:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://codeberg.org/YR-Design/mitsue-ai-data-center\ncd mitsue-ai-data-center\ngit pull   # make sure backup is current\nbash vps_setup.sh openproject.yourdomain.com\n```\n\nThe script will:\n\n1. Install Docker\n2. Copy and configure `openproject_docker-compose.yml`\n3. Start all OpenProject containers\n4. Restore the full database from `openproject_backup.sql`\n5. Install Caddy and issue a Let's Encrypt SSL certificate\n6. Configure the firewall (UFW)\n\n## After setup\n\n* **Add team members** — Admin → Users → Invite\n* **Update OPENPROJECT.md** — change URL from `localhost:8080` to `https://yourdomain.com`\n* **Point agents to new URL** — update API calls in OpenClaw / Hermes configs\n* **Run backup regularly** — `bash openproject_backup.sh` pushes to Codeberg + GitHub\n\n## HTTP-only (no domain)\n\n```bash\nbash vps_setup.sh   # no domain argument\n```\n\nOpenProject is then accessible on `http://<vps-ip>:8080`. Add a domain + SSL later.\n
9	4	# Project TODO — Infrastructure & Onboarding\n\nTracked items for when the team grows or infrastructure moves to a VPS.\n\n## Infrastructure\n\n- [ ] **Move OpenProject to VPS** — run `bash vps_setup.sh yourdomain.com` on a Hetzner/Vultr server\n- [ ] **Register a domain** for OpenProject (e.g. `op.mitsue-project.org`)\n- [ ] **Update OPENPROJECT.md** with new public URL after VPS move\n- [ ] **Set up automated backups** — cron job on VPS running `openproject_backup.sh` nightly\n- [ ] **Update agent API tokens** in OpenClaw and Hermes after VPS move\n\n## When New Members Join\n\n- [ ] Create OpenProject account (Admin → Users → Invite)\n- [ ] Add as project member with appropriate role (Member / Manager)\n- [ ] Share Codeberg repo access (or GitHub mirror)\n- [ ] Send link to [[Wiki]] home page as project orientation\n- [ ] Brief them on [[Documents]] — key reading: Project Overview + Founding Charter\n- [ ] Add to stakeholder list in `mitsue_stakeholders.md` if applicable\n\n## Documents\n\n- [ ] **mitsue_letter_pellegrom_support_request** — send final version to Consul General\n- [ ] **mitsue_mayor_meeting_talking_points** — update after next village meeting\n- [ ] Add Japanese translation of Q&A Briefing (`mitsue_qa_briefing_jp.md`)\n\n## Legal\n\n- [ ] Incorporate NGO/NPO in Japan (認定NPO法人) — Phase 0 task\n- [ ] Draft bilingual NDA template for advisors and contractors\n\n---\n*Update this page as tasks are completed or added.*\n
